.TH RBLDNS 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.6.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rbldns \- serve a DNS block-list database
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rbldns
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serves a compiled address block-list database beneath the required base name.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B BASE
Required DNS suffix for block-list queries.
.TP
.B DATA
Database path (default: data.cdb).
.TP
.B IP, PORT
Listen address and port (defaults: 0.0.0.0 and 53).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rbldns-data (1),
.BR rbldns-conf (1)
